START-OF-LOG: 3.0
CONTEST: WW-DIGI
CALLSIGN: NN7SS
LOCATION: WWA
CATEGORY-OPERATOR: SINGLE-OP
CATEGORY-ASSISTED:
CATEGORY-BAND: ALL
CATEGORY-POWER: QRP
CATEGORY-MODE: DIGI
